---
pagination:
  data: cards
  size: 1
  alias: card
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "/cards/{{ card.id }}/index.html"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ card.name }}"
  description: "What the Elixir record holds about {{ card.name }} in Clash Royale: how often it is played, how often it wins, by mode and by month."
  canonical: "/cards/{{ card.id }}"
layout: base.njk
navActive: cards
---
{#- A card's record (canvas 2026-09-29, CardPage). PUBLIC and sign-in
    free: this is where a forwarded Card of the Week lands, and where the
    cards index links. The catalog facts are baked at build time and read
    true with JavaScript off; cards-live.js fills the season's numbers
    from /api/public/cards/<id>, one mode at a time, because modes are
    different games and are never added together. Every number on the
    page is the API's. -#}
{%- set formName = {"hero": "Hero", "evolution": "Evo", "base": ""}[card.artForm] %}
{%- set suffix = {"hero": "_hero", "evolution": "_evo", "base": ""}[card.artForm] %}
<div class="flex flex-col gap-[22px] pt-7 pb-2" data-card="{{ card.id }}">
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-ink-faint">
    <a href="/cards/" data-card-crumb>Cards</a>
    <span class="flex" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "chevron-right", 14 %}</span>
    <span class="text-ink-dim" aria-current="page">{{ card.name }}</span>
  </nav>

  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-7 gap-y-4">
    <span class="card-figure">
      <span class="card-art">
        <span class="card-art__frame">
          <img class="card-art__img" src="/assets/cards/{{ card.id }}{{ suffix }}-285.png" alt="{{ (formName + ' ') if formName }}{{ card.name }}" width="92" height="136" data-name="{{ card.name }}" />
          {%- if formName %}
          <span class="card-art__form card-art__form--{{ card.artForm }}">{{ formName }}</span>
          {%- endif %}
        </span>
      </span>
      <span class="card-elixir card-elixir--lg" aria-label="{{ card.elixir }} elixir">{{ card.elixir }}</span>
    </span>
    <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-auto flex-col gap-[10px]">
      <h1 class="hero-title m-0">{{ card.name }}</h1>
      <p class="m-0 text-[15px] text-ink-dim">
        {{ card.rarity | capitalize }} {{ card.type }} &middot; {{ card.elixir }} elixir{% if card.also %} &middot; {{ card.also }}{% endif %}
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-card-chips hidden>
        <span class="chip chip--mute" data-card-issue hidden>{% icon "mail", 13 %}<span data-card-issue-text></span></span>
        <span class="chip chip--mute" data-card-rank hidden></span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <span class="chip chip--ok" data-card-updated hidden><span class="chip__dot"></span><span data-card-updated-text></span></span>
  </div>

  <div class="card-modes" role="group" aria-label="Mode" data-card-modes hidden></div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 wide:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="card-stat">
      <span class="card-stat__label">Share of decks</span>
      <span class="card-stat__value" data-card-live="share">&mdash;</span>
      <span class="card-stat__note" data-card-live="share-note">in the mode&rsquo;s battles</span>
    </div>
    <div class="card-stat">
      <span class="card-stat__label">Wins</span>
      <span class="card-stat__value" data-card-live="wins">&mdash;</span>
      <span class="card-stat__note" data-card-live="wins-note">when it was in the deck</span>
    </div>
    <div class="card-stat">
      <span class="card-stat__label">Battles</span>
      <span class="card-stat__value" data-card-live="battles">&mdash;</span>
      <span class="card-stat__note">with the card</span>
    </div>
    <div class="card-stat">
      <span class="card-stat__label">Players</span>
      <span class="card-stat__value" data-card-live="players">&mdash;</span>
      <span class="card-stat__note">who played it</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-4 wide:grid-cols-5">
    <section class="panel flex flex-col wide:col-span-3" aria-labelledby="card-months-h">
      <div class="panel__head">
        <h2 id="card-months-h" class="m-0 flex-auto text-[14px] font-semibold">By month</h2>
        <span class="chip chip--mute">every mode together</span>
      </div>
      <div class="panel__body">
        <div class="card-months" data-card-live="months">
          <p class="footnote m-0">Loading the record&hellip;</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel__note">
        Months are kept for every mode together today, so this chart stays
        the same when you pick a mode above.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel flex flex-col wide:col-span-2" aria-labelledby="card-bymode-h">
      <div class="panel__head">
        <h2 id="card-bymode-h" class="m-0 flex-auto text-[14px] font-semibold">By mode</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="table__scroll">
        <table class="table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col" class="uppercase">Mode</th>
              <th scope="col" class="text-right uppercase">Battles</th>
              <th scope="col" class="text-right uppercase">Share</th>
              <th scope="col" class="text-right uppercase">Wins</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody data-card-live="modes">
            <tr><td colspan="4" class="text-ink-faint">Loading the record&hellip;</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="panel__note">
        Each mode is its own game with its own matchmaking. Thin: under
        2,000 battles.
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-4 wide:grid-cols-2">
    <section class="panel flex flex-col" aria-labelledby="card-agent-h">
      <div class="panel__head">
        <h2 id="card-agent-h" class="m-0 flex-auto text-[14px] font-semibold">Ask your agent</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="panel__body flex flex-col gap-3">
        <pre class="card-call"><span class="text-ink-faint">// what your agent calls</span>
cards_card { card: "{{ card.name }}", segment: "corpus", mode: "<span data-card-live="agent-mode">ranked</span>" }</pre>
        <p class="m-0 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-ink-faint">
          Pass <code>segment: "mine"</code> and the same numbers come from
          your own battles. <a href="/docs/cards">How a card is counted</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel flex flex-col" aria-labelledby="card-cotw-h">
      <div class="panel__head">
        <h2 id="card-cotw-h" class="m-0 flex-auto text-[14px] font-semibold">Card of the Week</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="panel__body flex flex-col gap-3">
        <p class="m-0 text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-body" data-card-live="issue-line">
          Every Friday, one card the record has something to say about,
          read in full and sent to every Elixir account. A program draws it
          from the season&rsquo;s ten most-played cards that have not had
          an issue in the last year.
        </p>
        <p class="m-0 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[13.5px]">
          <a href="/docs/email">How Card of the Week is chosen &rsaquo;</a>
          <a href="/console/signin?request">Request access &rsaquo;</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<script defer src="{{ "/assets/cards-live.js" | asset }}"></script>
